{
 "comment": "Seagallop ferry, Vermilion side (pokefirered VermilionCity/scripts.inc VermilionCity_EventScript_FerrySailor + CheckSeagallopPresent, and data/scripts/seagallop.inc). The source branches on the One Island PC scene var (its record of the Sevii story: >= 5 Rainbow Pass era, >= 1 Tri-Pass era, 0 = the ship has set sail); the PUW form branches on the pass the player HOLDS, via the host's transient flags ferry_tri_pass / ferry_rainbow_pass (the host reads the real bag -- PUWLiveBag over the canonical ids tri-pass / rainbow-pass -- exactly as it supplies fossil picks in the events prep; the runner has no item-check op). With a Rainbow Pass the source first honours the event tickets (MysticTicket -> Navel Rock, AuroraTicket -> Birth Island; the source's FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_* distribution flags have no PUW counterpart -- holding the ticket IS the enablement). The ticket recognition lines play only until their FLAG_SHOWN_*_TICKET is set: the host's ferry_mystic_ticket / ferry_aurora_ticket flags carry that 'not yet shown' condition and the script sets the shown_mystic_ticket / shown_aurora_ticket story flags itself right after each line. A ticket holder's boarding line is the generic BoardSeagallopFerry (the source's Has*Ticket scripts); a ticketless Rainbow holder hears BoardSeagallopRainbowPass -- the host's ferry_any_ticket flag selects between them. Then offers the Sevii destinations pages (all seven islands). The destination itself is the host's menu: the host sets exactly one ferry_dest_* flag, or none when the player cancels (the source's CancelSail: the script simply ends). Departing lines are the source's own: from Vermilion, VermilionCity_Text_Seagallop7Departing (bank _common) for the islands, Seagallop10Departing / Seagallop12Departing for the ticket islands. The warp step is the scripted transfer the reachability audit prescribes (B-06): NO warp-data edge is added anywhere; arrival is the destination harbor's sole warp (id 1). The sailor is a NEW interactable on VermilionDock (see sevii_ferry_wiring.json -- the bound dock map has no objects; in FRLG the ferry sailor stands on Vermilion City's pier).",
